    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "but what if i don't want to just \"survive\" anymore? what if the idea of constantly fighting to glue pieces back together that will never fit right again just sounds... pointless. it feels like some things are just meant to stay broken. is it really so wrong to just accept that i'm beyond help?",
